---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/reading-hours-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/reading-hours-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="Time to a first shortlist: 27 to 54 hours becomes 2 to 4"
  caption="Reading time only, before any phone screen. The 124 notes are an estimate and a bet until the calls start."
>
  Three bars. Reading all 816 applications by hand at two to four minutes each: 27 to 54 hours. Reading the 124 research notes first, at a minute or two each: 2 to 4 hours. Then the 660 maybes, read in order: not yet estimated.
</Chart>
